register-form assertion and a spill fixture whose small constants now no longer
created pressure. The latter retains its real-spill assertion, using constants
4097..4136 and the corresponding exact sum. All 35 existing lowering/native
tests then pass. Final affected gate against c96d55f: 1027 PASS / 0 FAIL /
4 historical ignored; Clippy -D warnings and fmt PASS. This is not a complete
workspace/offline-replay claim.

